// DerivedSheet is everything the server computes from a character's full
// sheet (MR-004): the app shows these numbers as they come and never
// computes a rule itself.
//
// Derived numbers are never stored: the server computes them again on every
// read, from the sheet and the current rules content. A newer content
// version can therefore change a number on a locked sheet; content_version
// says which content produced these numbers.
//
